Z||000003||cobra427||01-08-2000||03:22 AM||||I bought a set from the Fiero Store and was very pleased with them. The h/light housing was made in India(can't compare with the equivalent Hella's)but they do get the job done quite nicely. The H-4 bulb is a 65/55 watt bulb. There are also 130/100 watt bulbs you can get from Chris West in Ca.<BR>The bulb color is a really neat bluesh green. Not like the really blue color that the Lexus,Mersades,BMW's have ,but a real nice addition.||||reg||1
